       "t": "Speedrun: keep killing Windfury Matriarchs until you are about 2,950 XP short of 12 (5,850 XP into level 11). The hand-ins still ahead (Preparation for Ceremony, Rites of the Earthmother, Wildmane Totem, Sergra Darkthorn) give exactly that. If Arra'chea isn't up or you have no leather for Veren, grind that much longer (Arra'chea is 1,250 XP, the leather quests 1,300)."
